Branding and Mascot Usage Guidelines
====================================

Lochy Mascot
------------

The "Lochy" character — including all illustrations, renderings, and SVGs of the
Loch Ness Monster mascot with respect to the reference in the assets directory —
is a protected brand asset of this project.

While the source code of the project is licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later (see
LICENSE), the mascot artwork itself is licensed under separate terms.

You MAY:
- Publish, host, and embed badges generated by this program, including badges
  that contain the default Lochy artwork. That output is covered by the output
  exception in LICENSE_EXCEPTION, section 1, and needs no permission.
- Use the unmodified Lochy mascot in official forks of this repository for
  personal, non-commercial projects.
- Point the `mascot` input at your own image; badges rendered from your own
  artwork are yours without restriction.

You MAY NOT:
- Extract, crop, or reconstruct the mascot from a generated badge and reuse it
  as an image asset
- Modify, remix, or rebrand the Lochy mascot
- Use the mascot or logo as the mark of an unrelated project
- Use the mascot in a commercial product without permission

The distinction is between the artifact and the asset: a badge this program
produced is output and may be shared; the mascot as a standalone image is not.

For commercial or derivative use of the artwork, please contact the project
maintainers.

